	"notice": "Configure MIDI port routing, per-track channels, note reception and clock send/receive in MIDI settings. Trig buttons change function with the selected mode; parameter encoders and external MIDI CC destinations depend on the track and machine. This entry covers Digitakt II only. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
